      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "So from the starting instant to the second 120-km separation, relative distance = 240 km.\nAt speeds 60 and 40 km/hr, relative speed = 100 km/hr.\nTime = 240/100 = 2.4 h.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
